OL,3,GNEWSAFallen power line may have caused
OL,4,Agrass fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fallen power line may have caused a
OL,7,Fgrass fire which broke out in Moray
OL,8,Fearlier this week, it has emerged.
OL,10,FFirefighters spent the night near the
OL,11,FMoray village of Hopeman after the
OL,12,Fblaze broke out on Tuesday afternoon.
OL,14,FSix appliances and a wildfire unit were
OL,15,Fsent to the scene.
OL,17,FScottish and Southern Electricity
OL,18,FNetworks (SSEN) said it believed an
OL,19,Foverhead line coming down may have
OL,20,F"contributed" to the incident.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
